<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The tall sisters)</font>

1582
00:39:52,090 --> 00:39:53,330
<font size="64">That's right. Your legs.</font>

1583
00:39:56,600 --> 00:39:58,130
<font size="64">Nice. Eun Chae is doing well.</font>

1584
00:39:57,170 --> 00:39:59,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She's kicking the air as hard as she can.)</font>

1585
00:39:58,130 --> 00:39:59,640
<font size="64">- Good! - Nice.</font>

1586
00:39:59,740 --> 00:40:01,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Spinning)</font>

1587
00:39:59,900 --> 00:40:01,900
<font size="64">Ye Eun as well. She's doing well.</font>

1588
00:40:02,170 --> 00:40:03,210
<font size="64">Good.</font>

1589
00:40:03,210 --> 00:40:04,670
<font size="64">One, two, three!</font>

1590
00:40:04,710 --> 00:40:05,910
<font size="64">- Okay! - Okay!</font>

1591
00:40:04,970 --> 00:40:07,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The quick breakdancing show ends.)</font>

1592
00:40:07,580 --> 00:40:08,580
<font size="64">Will you really give them?</font>

1593
00:40:08,580 --> 00:40:09,580
<font size="64">- Can we really have some? - Get one piece each.</font>

1594
00:40:09,280 --> 00:40:11,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He pays them in chicken.)</font>

1595
00:40:09,580 --> 00:40:11,480
<font size="64">- Thank you. - Get a big piece.</font>

1596
00:40:11,480 --> 00:40:12,750
<font size="64">This sauce is the kick.</font>

1597
00:40:12,150 --> 00:40:13,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Offering the sauce)</font>

1598
00:40:12,750 --> 00:40:13,980
<font size="64">- Thank you. - It's good.</font>

1599
00:40:13,650 --> 00:40:15,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's become generous after becoming a tycoon.)</font>

1600
00:40:13,980 --> 00:40:15,890
<font size="64">- Here. - Is this a chicken drumette?</font>

1601
00:40:17,350 --> 00:40:20,290
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Detective finally gets a bite of the chicken as well.)</font>

1602
00:40:17,790 --> 00:40:19,020
<font size="64">This sauce is the kick.</font>

1603
00:40:20,820 --> 00:40:22,020
<font size="64">This sauce is the kick.</font>

1604
00:40:22,020 --> 00:40:23,430
<font size="64">The wings are good too.</font>

1605
00:40:23,190 --> 00:40:24,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Exclaiming)</font>

1606
00:40:25,630 --> 00:40:26,930
<font size="64">- It's good. - It's good.</font>

1607
00:40:25,860 --> 00:40:27,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Speaking at the same time)</font>

1608
00:40:28,800 --> 00:40:31,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A beastly eating show of the protein killer)</font>

1609
00:40:32,570 --> 00:40:35,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He debones the piece with his protruding mouth.)</font>

1610
00:40:32,970 --> 00:40:34,200
<font size="64">It's good!</font>

1611
00:40:35,840 --> 00:40:38,140
<font size="64">- I keep hearing the crunchy sound. - Right.</font>

1612
00:40:39,040 --> 00:40:42,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Both teams enjoyed the chicken together.)</font>

1613
00:40:39,340 --> 00:40:40,680
<font size="64">This is good.</font>

1614
00:40:40,680 --> 00:40:42,610
<font size="64">- I'm full. - We enjoyed the chicken.</font>

1615
00:40:42,680 --> 00:40:45,680
<font size="64">The last mission with the hint...</font>

1616
00:40:45,750 --> 00:40:47,350
<font size="64">is called the Flex of the Tycoons.</font>

1617
00:40:46,250 --> 00:40:48,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Mission 2: The Flex of the Tycoons)</font>

1618
00:40:47,350 --> 00:40:48,720
<font size="64">- What mission is it? - I guess we're going to buy things.</font>

1619
00:40:48,750 --> 00:40:51,450
<font size="64">Each team will receive one card...</font>

1620
00:40:51,450 --> 00:40:52,890
<font size="64">containing the same amount of money.</font>

1621
00:40:53,190 --> 00:40:54,860
<font size="64">The team that guesses the card limit...</font>

1622
00:40:53,320 --> 00:40:55,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(150 dollars, 200 dollars)</font>

1623
00:40:54,860 --> 00:40:58,330
<font size="64">and buys the most expensive item wins.</font>

1624
00:40:55,720 --> 00:40:57,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Payment amount: 150 dollars, Payment amount: 200 dollars)</font>

1625
00:40:57,130 --> 00:40:59,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Win)</font>

1626
00:40:58,390 --> 00:41:01,130
<font size="64">If the card limit is exceeded during payment,</font>

1627
00:40:59,730 --> 00:41:01,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(500 dollars)</font>

1628
00:41:01,130 --> 00:41:02,500
<font size="64">the mission fails immediately.</font>

1629
00:41:01,930 --> 00:41:03,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Fail)</font>

1630
00:41:03,030 --> 00:41:04,830
<font size="64">Will it be the price of just one item?</font>

1631
00:41:04,830 --> 00:41:07,470
<font size="64">The price of one item must be the highest.</font>

1632
00:41:04,870 --> 00:41:09,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Even if they buy multiple items, only the most expensive one counts.)</font>

1633
00:41:08,700 --> 00:41:10,970
<font size="64">- Will we take what we buy? - No.</font>

1634
00:41:11,070 --> 00:41:13,240
<font size="64">- During payment... - He wants to buy batteries again.</font>

1635
00:41:13,280 --> 00:41:16,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The household essentials enthusiast is taking this chance to stock up.)</font>

1636
00:41:13,410 --> 00:41:14,780
<font size="64">Windshield washer fluid and batteries.</font>

1637
00:41:14,780 --> 00:41:15,910
<font size="64">- Essentials. - Essentials.</font>

1638
00:41:15,910 --> 00:41:17,080
<font size="64">The items you buy...</font>

1639
00:41:17,080 --> 00:41:19,280
<font size="64">will go to the final winning team.</font>

1640
00:41:19,280 --> 00:41:21,650
<font size="64">The spy will try to exceed the limit.</font>

1641
00:41:21,650 --> 00:41:22,650
<font size="64">- That's possible. - That's possible.</font>

1642
00:41:22,650 --> 00:41:23,890
<font size="64">What happens if we exceed the limit in the first try?</font>

1643
00:41:23,890 --> 00:41:24,890
<font size="64">We won't get to buy anything?</font>

1644
00:41:24,620 --> 00:41:25,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If their card explodes on their first purchase,)</font>

1645
00:41:24,890 --> 00:41:26,260
<font size="64">You fail. Right.</font>

1646
00:41:25,790 --> 00:41:26,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(they immediately fail the mission.)</font>

1647
00:41:26,720 --> 00:41:28,920
<font size="64">- Are you the chairman? - We should... Pardon?</font>

1648
00:41:28,920 --> 00:41:30,560
<font size="64">- The chairman... - That's also possible, right?</font>

1649
00:41:29,120 --> 00:41:33,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The spy may try to go above the limit to sabotage the mission.)</font>

1650
00:41:30,860 --> 00:41:31,890
<font size="64">Yes.</font>

1651
00:41:32,260 --> 00:41:33,900
<font size="64">It's a possibility.</font>

1652
00:41:34,200 --> 00:41:36,430
<font size="64">If the secretary gets the card,</font>

1653
00:41:36,430 --> 00:41:38,300
<font size="64">the secretary will buy something that exceeds the limit.</font>

1654
00:41:38,630 --> 00:41:40,600
<font size="64">- Right. - You're right,</font>

1655
00:41:40,870 --> 00:41:42,500
<font size="64">- but then they'll get caught. - Of course.</font>

1656
00:41:43,210 --> 00:41:46,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They should watch out for who the spy is.)</font>

1657
00:41:43,370 --> 00:41:44,440
<font size="64">The secretary is going to try to bait us.</font>

1658
00:41:45,670 --> 00:41:47,810
<font size="64">The teams will move out together...</font>

1659
00:41:47,810 --> 00:41:49,950
<font size="64">- and start purchasing. - Okay, let's go.</font>

1660
00:41:50,180 --> 00:41:52,680
<font size="64">Do you know what I hate? The obvious numbers.</font>

1661
00:41:52,750 --> 00:41:54,550
<font size="64">- I bet it's over 100 dollars. - Like 50, 100, and 150.</font>

1662
00:41:54,550 --> 00:41:56,250
<font size="64">- It won't be that. - I doubt that'll be the case.</font>

1663
00:41:55,180 --> 00:41:58,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Se Chan thinks the card limit won't be a round number.)</font>

1664
00:41:56,250 --> 00:41:57,390
<font size="64">- I doubt it. - I hate things like that.</font>

1665
00:41:57,490 --> 00:41:59,690
<font size="64">- Eun Chae, what's your take on it? - What do you think?</font>

1666
00:41:59,690 --> 00:42:01,360
<font size="64">- What's your guess? - How much do you think it'll be?</font>

1667
00:42:01,360 --> 00:42:02,390
<font size="64">I think it'll be low.</font>

1668
00:42:02,390 --> 00:42:03,860
<font size="64">- A low number? - Really?</font>

1669
00:42:03,860 --> 00:42:05,390
<font size="64">- Wait. - Is it you?</font>

1670
00:42:04,260 --> 00:42:06,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Are you the spy?)</font>

1671
00:42:05,390 --> 00:42:06,700
<font size="64">- What do you mean? - No?</font>

1672
00:42:06,700 --> 00:42:08,360
<font size="64">She thinks the number will be low.</font>

1673
00:42:08,360 --> 00:42:09,630
<font size="64">- She can't be the spy. - Why not?</font>

1674
00:42:09,830 --> 00:42:12,030
<font size="64">Because she thinks the number will be low.</font>

1675
00:42:11,170 --> 00:42:13,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jong Kook's deduction: The spy will buy something expensive...)</font>

1676
00:42:12,030 --> 00:42:13,340
<font size="64">She won't buy enough to go over the limit.</font>

1677
00:42:13,170 --> 00:42:15,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(to go over the limit.)</font>

1678
00:42:13,340 --> 00:42:15,270
<font size="64">But a cheaper item...</font>

1679
00:42:15,140 --> 00:42:17,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Smart)</font>

1680
00:42:15,270 --> 00:42:17,470
<font size="64">- We'll lose. Yes, you're right. - Yes, we'll lose.</font>

1681
00:42:17,670 --> 00:42:21,080
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Is Eun Chae, who thought the limit would be low, the spy?)</font>

1682
00:42:17,740 --> 00:42:19,640
<font size="64">You're right. We'll lose if our item is cheaper.</font>

1683
00:42:19,640 --> 00:42:20,740
<font size="64">- Exactly. - Right.</font>

1684
00:42:21,510 --> 00:42:23,350
<font size="64">I believe we have to spend at least 100 dollars.</font>

1685
00:42:23,810 --> 00:42:24,880
<font size="64">At least 100?</font>

1686
00:42:25,510 --> 00:42:26,620
<font size="64">How else are we supposed to win?</font>

1687
00:42:25,920 --> 00:42:28,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Se Chan thinks they should spend a large amount to win.)</font>

1688
00:42:26,950 --> 00:42:29,120
<font size="64">- Are you the undercover secretary? - I doubt it'll be over 100 dollars.</font>

1689
00:42:28,720 --> 00:42:31,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Suspecting Se Chan right away)</font>

1690
00:42:31,320 --> 00:42:32,590
<font size="64">Shin Bi, give me a break, will you?</font>

1691
00:42:32,590 --> 00:42:34,020
<font size="64">- Is this your task as a secretary? - Of course not.</font>

1692
00:42:34,590 --> 00:42:35,960
<font size="64">Jong Kook, hear me out.</font>

1693
00:42:35,960 --> 00:42:37,660
<font size="64">If we only spend 30 to 50 dollars...</font>

1694
00:42:37,660 --> 00:42:39,600
<font size="64">- and lose... - That's not enough.</font>

1695
00:42:39,600 --> 00:42:41,300
<font size="64">They're going to spend a decent amount of money.</font>

1696
00:42:42,130 --> 00:42:45,100
<font size="64">- It can't be 30 to 50 dollars. - They gave us this card to use.</font>

1697
00:42:43,470 --> 00:42:47,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Shin Bi is suspicious of Se Chan who wants to make a big purchase.)</font>

1698
00:42:45,100 --> 00:42:46,470
<font size="64">It's not right to only spend it...</font>

1699
00:42:46,470 --> 00:42:47,640
<font size="64">- on something small. - Exactly.</font>

1700
00:42:47,870 --> 00:42:50,140
<font size="64">It'll be so annoying if we lose to the other team...</font>

1701
00:42:50,140 --> 00:42:52,110
<font size="64">by only buying something small.</font>

1702
00:42:52,310 --> 00:42:54,880
<font size="64">- You see, earlier... - I'd rather spend over the limit.</font>

1703
00:42:55,080 --> 00:42:58,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's better to spend over the limit?)</font>

1704
00:42:55,180 --> 00:42:58,150
<font size="64">By buying something small...</font>

1705
00:42:58,650 --> 00:43:00,650
<font size="64">- By buying something small... - Don't we lose our chance...</font>

1706
00:43:00,650 --> 00:43:01,650
<font size="64">if we spend over the limit?</font>

1707
00:43:01,650 --> 00:43:02,990
<font size="64">- That's right. - It's game over.</font>

1708
00:43:02,990 --> 00:43:05,490
<font size="64">- He said that was better. - We'd lose the game.</font>

1709
00:43:03,920 --> 00:43:05,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Suspicious)</font>

1710
00:43:05,490 --> 00:43:07,020
<font size="64">- Who said that? - I'd rather spend over the limit.</font>

1711
00:43:07,720 --> 00:43:09,890
<font size="64">- Me? - Yes, you said that.</font>

1712
00:43:09,490 --> 00:43:12,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Detective Shin Bi is putting pressure on him.)</font>

1713
00:43:09,890 --> 00:43:12,190
<font size="64">- You just said so. - That's just how I feel.</font>

1714
00:43:12,260 --> 00:43:13,600
<font size="64">Let's say we lost after only spending 30 dollars.</font>

1715
00:43:13,600 --> 00:43:15,400
<font size="64">What if we lost after not spending enough?</font>

1716
00:43:13,630 --> 00:43:16,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Viper eyes)</font>

1717
00:43:15,800 --> 00:43:17,470
<font size="64">You'd be better off taking a beating from me.</font>

1718
00:43:18,670 --> 00:43:21,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Kim Thug is undercover as a detective.)</font>

1719
00:43:20,400 --> 00:43:23,110
<font size="64">- You're killing me. - That could be better.</font>

1720
00:43:23,570 --> 00:43:25,210
<font size="64">Just hear me out.</font>

1721
00:43:25,440 --> 00:43:27,240
<font size="64">I'm saying if we're going to lose,</font>

1722
00:43:27,240 --> 00:43:29,480
<font size="64">it'll feel better to lose after going over the limit.</font>

1723
00:43:29,480 --> 00:43:31,510
<font size="64">- If that's the case? - Not spending enough...</font>

1724
00:43:31,510 --> 00:43:32,680
<font size="64">- and losing to them... - Rather than spending less?</font>

1725
00:43:32,680 --> 00:43:34,250
<font size="64">- You're focusing on how it'll feel. - Exactly.</font>

1726
00:43:33,180 --> 00:43:35,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He narrowly escaped suspicion.)</font>

1727
00:43:34,250 --> 00:43:35,820
<font size="64">- That's where my focus is. - I see.</font>

1728
00:43:36,290 --> 00:43:38,050
<font size="64">Nothing gets past Shin Bi.</font>

1729
00:43:38,690 --> 00:43:42,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(While Shin Bi, a great detective, is investigating...)</font>

1730
00:43:39,320 --> 00:43:40,490
<font size="64">He questions everything we say.</font>

1731
00:43:40,490 --> 00:43:42,160
<font size="64">- Keep it up, then. - Right.</font>

1732
00:43:42,260 --> 00:43:44,230
<font size="64">- By the way... - Yes, Seok Jin?</font>

1733
00:43:45,160 --> 00:43:47,200
<font size="64">Since Bo Hyun plays a detective in the show,</font>

1734
00:43:47,200 --> 00:43:48,730
<font size="64">would he really play one again with us?</font>

1735
00:43:48,730 --> 00:43:49,830
<font size="64">I'm not the spy.</font>

1736
00:43:50,070 --> 00:43:52,470
<font size="64">- They don't give me any tasks. - Really?</font>

1737
00:43:52,470 --> 00:43:54,140
<font size="64">Wouldn't one of the guests have a special role today?</font>

1738
00:43:54,140 --> 00:43:55,500
<font size="64">- Absolutely. - Of course.</font>

1739
00:43:55,500 --> 00:43:57,010
<font size="64">- I'm sure of it. - It's not me.</font>

1740
00:43:57,010 --> 00:43:58,140
<font size="64">- I agree. - I think it's Bo Hyun.</font>

1741
00:43:58,140 --> 00:43:59,740
<font size="64">- Sang Jun, isn't it you? - It's not me.</font>

1742
00:43:59,740 --> 00:44:01,240
<font size="64">It was a little upsetting...</font>

1743
00:44:01,240 --> 00:44:02,950
<font size="64">since they didn't give me a role to play,</font>

1744
00:44:02,140 --> 00:44:04,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(His 2nd appearance on Running Man)</font>

1745
00:44:02,950 --> 00:44:04,710
<font size="64">even though I thought it was about time.</font>

1746
00:44:04,780 --> 00:44:06,320
<font size="64">- By the way, - Really?</font>

1747
00:44:06,320 --> 00:44:08,780
<font size="64">the chairman must be feeling lonely,</font>

1748
00:44:08,780 --> 00:44:10,050
<font size="64">but you can trust me.</font>

1749
00:44:10,050 --> 00:44:12,760
<font size="64">- Chairman. - Tell me whatever is bothering you.</font>

1750
00:44:11,420 --> 00:44:13,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They're trying to butter up the chairman in the meantime.)</font>

1751
00:44:12,760 --> 00:44:14,460
<font size="64">- Thank you, Chairman. - Chairman.</font>

1752
00:44:14,460 --> 00:44:15,920
<font size="64">- Chairman... - I don't know who you are but...</font>

1753
00:44:16,030 --> 00:44:18,460
<font size="64">Doesn't the chairman need to get out safely today?</font>

1754
00:44:18,460 --> 00:44:19,700
<font size="64">How is the chairman supposed to do that?</font>

1755
00:44:19,800 --> 00:44:21,360
<font size="64">You can open the door and just get out.</font>

1756
00:44:22,430 --> 00:44:25,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The chairman has to jump out of the moving car.)</font>

1757
00:44:26,170 --> 00:44:27,500
<font size="64">- I'm asking because... - Open the door and...</font>

1758
00:44:26,840 --> 00:44:29,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Perfect teamwork)</font>

1759
00:44:27,500 --> 00:44:29,940
<font size="64">- You'll know how, right? - Say you're escaping.</font>

1760
00:44:29,940 --> 00:44:31,410
<font size="64">- Say you're escaping. - Exactly.</font>

1761
00:44:31,410 --> 00:44:32,510
<font size="64">- Eject! - Eject.</font>

1762
00:44:32,510 --> 00:44:33,610
<font size="64">And hop out.</font>

1763
00:44:33,080 --> 00:44:35,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It looks like a huge escape scene is coming up.)</font>

1764
00:44:35,280 --> 00:44:37,380
<font size="64">Let's buy something we can take home.</font>

1765
00:44:36,450 --> 00:44:38,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Detective arrives at a nearby shopping district.)</font>

1766
00:44:38,110 --> 00:44:40,220
<font size="64">Let's go. Let's see what our options are.</font>

1767
00:44:41,020 --> 00:44:42,920
<font size="64">- We'll... - How about a door lock?</font>

1768
00:44:42,920 --> 00:44:44,090
<font size="64">- What? - I mean...</font>

1769
00:44:44,090 --> 00:44:45,490
<font size="64">- Wait, the door lock? - How about a door lock?</font>

1770
00:44:44,550 --> 00:44:47,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He immediately found a practical item for everyday life.)</font>

1771
00:44:45,490 --> 00:44:46,720
<font size="64">- That's expensive. - I should get a new one.</font>

1772
00:44:46,720 --> 00:44:47,920
<font size="64">It'll be nice to get a new one.</font>

