2072
00:52:02,920 --> 00:52:04,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If it doesn't get declined, Haha is likely the spy.)</font>

2073
00:52:02,960 --> 00:52:04,130
<font size="64">You want to reduce the amount.</font>

2074
00:52:04,130 --> 00:52:06,130
