2742
01:10:16,380 --> 01:10:20,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He must cut another wire without a hint!)</font>

2743
01:10:19,490 --> 01:10:20,490
<font size="64">All right.</font>

2744
01:10:21,590 --> 01:10:22,760
<font size="64">I need to hurry up.</font>

2745
01:10:22,160 --> 01:10:25,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chairman Ha is on pins and needles.)</font>

2746
01:10:22,760 --> 01:10:24,390
<font size="64">They're suspicious.</font>

2747
01:10:24,760 --> 01:10:26,890
<font size="64">They're nearly certain that I'm the chairman.</font>

2748
01:10:27,530 --> 01:10:28,600
<font size="64">It's strange.</font>

2749
01:10:28,230 --> 01:10:30,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He blindly chooses number 6, the yellow wire.)</font>

2750
01:10:31,070 --> 01:10:34,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will he get lucky and survive this time as well?)</font>

2751
01:10:32,400 --> 01:10:34,100
<font size="64">One, two...</font>

2752
01:10:34,200 --> 01:10:35,340
<font size="64">Hold on. In that case...</font>

2753
01:10:34,570 --> 01:10:37,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Meanwhile, Team Detective members are together.)</font>

2754
01:10:36,770 --> 01:10:38,540
<font size="64">- The chairman... - Let's go and find him.</font>

2755
01:10:38,540 --> 01:10:41,680
<font size="64">Since the chairman detonated the bomb,</font>

2756
01:10:41,680 --> 01:10:44,140
<font size="64">we'll give you a hint on his identity.</font>

2757
01:10:44,810 --> 01:10:46,350
<font size="64">- Give us the hint. Let's hear it. - Okay.</font>

2758
01:10:47,550 --> 01:10:48,620
<font size="64">Two, three.</font>

2759
01:10:49,020 --> 01:10:52,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chairman Ha cut the wrong wire.)</font>

2760
01:10:51,190 --> 01:10:53,090
<font size="64">The chairman must've cut the wrong wire.</font>

2761
01:10:53,090 --> 01:10:55,960
<font size="64">When Jong Kook lost a point during the jokgu mission,</font>

2762
01:10:55,960 --> 01:10:57,390
<font size="64">- the chairman laughed at him. - Come on.</font>

2763
01:10:57,390 --> 01:10:58,760
<font size="64">- It's Haha. - It's too easy.</font>

2764
01:10:58,760 --> 01:11:01,430
<font size="64">- Haha laughed at me loudly. - But everyone laughed at you.</font>

2765
01:11:01,960 --> 01:11:04,160
<font size="64">- I'm serious. - Come here.</font>

2766
01:11:04,160 --> 01:11:05,670
<font size="64">- But... - Everyone laughed at you.</font>

2767
01:11:05,670 --> 01:11:07,670
<font size="64">- Haha... - Jae Seok laughed at you loudly.</font>

2768
01:11:07,570 --> 01:11:09,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Correct)</font>

2769
01:11:07,670 --> 01:11:08,940
<font size="64">Haha was especially loud.</font>

2770
01:11:08,940 --> 01:11:10,640
<font size="64">- No. It was Jae Seok. - I saw...</font>

2771
01:11:11,010 --> 01:11:12,540
<font size="64">Seok Jin laugh at you.</font>

2772
01:11:14,010 --> 01:11:16,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(When Jong Kook failed to head the ball)</font>

2773
01:11:14,140 --> 01:11:16,110
<font size="64">That's it!</font>

2774
01:11:17,240 --> 01:11:21,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will they remember that Chairman Haha laughed loudly?)</font>

2775
01:11:22,050 --> 01:11:23,650
<font size="64">It could be Haha.</font>

2776
01:11:22,320 --> 01:11:24,080
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Correct)</font>

2777
01:11:23,650 --> 01:11:24,990
<font size="64">I don't think it's Haha.</font>

2778
01:11:24,990 --> 01:11:27,890
<font size="64">You think that way...</font>

2779
01:11:26,320 --> 01:11:30,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Detective gets closer to discovering Chairman Ha's identity.)</font>

2780
01:11:27,890 --> 01:11:29,890
<font size="64">because you look down on Haha.</font>

2781
01:11:29,890 --> 01:11:30,960
<font size="64">- Me? - Yes.</font>

2782
01:11:31,030 --> 01:11:32,860
<font size="64">Jong Kook is dangerous. It's in his tone.</font>

2783
01:11:33,090 --> 01:11:34,930
<font size="64">- Who? - Don't you agree?</font>

2784
01:11:33,330 --> 01:11:37,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(And Se Chan suspects Jong Kook of being a spy.)</font>

2785
01:11:34,930 --> 01:11:36,760
<font size="64">- He keeps framing me. - He does.</font>

2786
01:11:36,760 --> 01:11:37,770
<font size="64">- He keeps framing me, right? - Yes.</font>

2787
01:11:37,770 --> 01:11:39,130
<font size="64">- What? - Se Chan is the spy.</font>

2788
01:11:39,330 --> 01:11:43,870
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(On the contrary, Jong Kook is suspicious of Se Chan.)</font>

2789
01:11:39,330 --> 01:11:40,470
<font size="64">- That's why... - Se Chan is the spy. I'm certain.</font>

2790
01:11:40,470 --> 01:11:41,900
<font size="64">- he let them take the hints. - He did that.</font>

2791
01:11:41,900 --> 01:11:43,500
<font size="64">- That's the reason why. - He didn't show me the hints.</font>

2792
01:11:43,500 --> 01:11:45,540
<font size="64">He let them take the hints. I'm sure of it.</font>

2793
01:11:46,070 --> 01:11:48,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Se Chan searches other places.)</font>

2794
01:11:49,280 --> 01:11:50,940
<font size="64">Is this really a lecture room of Chung-Ang University?</font>

2795
01:11:50,940 --> 01:11:51,980
<font size="64">Yes.</font>

2796
01:11:52,580 --> 01:11:54,550
<font size="64">Had I been a good student, I would've sat here.</font>

2797
01:11:56,450 --> 01:11:58,020
<font size="64">Shall I listen to the lecture?</font>

2798
01:11:59,090 --> 01:12:00,190
<font size="64">So this is how it looks.</font>

2799
01:12:01,190 --> 01:12:02,620
<font size="64">Do they take roll calls?</font>

2800
01:12:03,020 --> 01:12:05,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Professor)</font>

2801
01:12:03,090 --> 01:12:04,930
<font size="64">- Yang Se Chan. - Yes?</font>

2802
01:12:06,660 --> 01:12:08,060
<font size="64">I'm Yang Se Chan and I entered in 2005.</font>

2803
01:12:08,330 --> 01:12:09,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Laughing)</font>

2804
01:12:10,560 --> 01:12:12,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Somewhere in a parallel universe,)</font>

2805
01:12:10,560 --> 01:12:11,600
<font size="64">Like that?</font>

2806
01:12:11,730 --> 01:12:13,130
<font size="64">- Yes. - All right.</font>

2807
01:12:12,770 --> 01:12:15,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(he entered Chung-Ang University in 2005.)</font>

2808
01:12:13,200 --> 01:12:14,270
<font size="64">Yes, I'm here.</font>

2809
01:12:15,070 --> 01:12:17,070
<font size="64">So that's how it goes. Does the professor stand there?</font>

2810
01:12:16,140 --> 01:12:17,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Detailed imagination)</font>

2811
01:12:17,740 --> 01:12:20,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(My goodness)</font>

2812
01:12:18,870 --> 01:12:19,970
<font size="64">It would've been cool.</font>

2813
01:12:20,410 --> 01:12:23,310
<font size="64">After the lecture, you take your books and leave.</font>

2814
01:12:23,780 --> 01:12:25,880
<font size="64">Hey. See you at the library later.</font>

2815
01:12:26,510 --> 01:12:27,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Laughing)</font>

2816
01:12:28,180 --> 01:12:29,380
<font size="64">Give me a break.</font>

2817
01:12:29,050 --> 01:12:30,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Startled)</font>

2818
01:12:30,820 --> 01:12:33,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Detective Kim was listening to everything.)</font>

2819
01:12:31,090 --> 01:12:33,220
<font size="64">- Give me a break. - Have you gone to a university?</font>

2820
01:12:33,220 --> 01:12:34,960
<font size="64">- Seriously. - I entered Chung-Ang University...</font>

2821
01:12:34,390 --> 01:12:37,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The Chung-Ang University student is blushing.)</font>

2822
01:12:34,960 --> 01:12:37,060
<font size="64">- in 2005. - For goodness' sake.</font>

2823
01:12:37,260 --> 01:12:38,760
<font size="64">Hey. For goodness' sake.</font>

2824
01:12:39,190 --> 01:12:40,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(No hint?)</font>

2825
01:12:39,360 --> 01:12:40,390
<font size="64">- Are there no hints? - No.</font>

2826
01:12:40,390 --> 01:12:42,960
<font size="64">You weren't even looking for them. You're suspicious.</font>

2827
01:12:42,960 --> 01:12:44,730
<font size="64">- What do you mean? - You're suspicious.</font>

2828
01:12:43,800 --> 01:12:46,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They're suspicious of each other.)</font>

2829
01:12:44,730 --> 01:12:46,230
<font size="64">- Jong Kook. - Se Chan.</font>

2830
01:12:46,230 --> 01:12:47,840
<font size="64">I need to find the handcuffs.</font>

2831
01:12:47,670 --> 01:12:51,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Is there the undercover secretary among the two of them?)</font>

2832
01:12:47,940 --> 01:12:48,970
<font size="64">Okay.</font>

2833
01:12:50,100 --> 01:12:51,170
<font size="64">This is driving me crazy.</font>

2834
01:12:51,440 --> 01:12:52,940
<font size="64">Hold on a second.</font>

2835
01:12:51,710 --> 01:12:53,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Meanwhile, Chairman Ha who detonated the bomb)</font>

2836
01:12:52,940 --> 01:12:55,280
<font size="64">I'll bring Jae Seok to get the questions right.</font>

2837
01:12:56,510 --> 01:12:58,510
<font size="64">That means the chairman is Haha.</font>

2838
01:12:57,240 --> 01:12:59,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Thanks to a hint, Jae Seok learns about Haha's identity.)</font>

2839
01:13:00,010 --> 01:13:03,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(And Haha begins to look for Jae Seok.)</font>

2840
01:13:02,180 --> 01:13:03,250
<font size="64">Where is he?</font>

2841
01:13:03,450 --> 01:13:04,650
<font size="64">- Yes. - What?</font>

2842
01:13:04,650 --> 01:13:06,120
<font size="64">- Jae Seok. - Where is Jae Seok?</font>

2843
01:13:05,390 --> 01:13:08,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He meets the rest of Team Flex.)</font>

2844
01:13:06,120 --> 01:13:07,790
<font size="64">- What? - Did you find many hints?</font>

2845
01:13:07,790 --> 01:13:10,590
<font size="64">I heard that you ripped off Jae Seok's name tag...</font>

2846
01:13:08,960 --> 01:13:11,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He checks the facts like a broken record.)</font>

2847
01:13:10,860 --> 01:13:12,090
<font size="64">and stole the hints.</font>

2848
01:13:12,360 --> 01:13:13,390
<font size="64">Really?</font>

2849
01:13:13,730 --> 01:13:16,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(All the tycoons learn about Bo Hyun's name tag fiasco!)</font>

2850
01:13:13,860 --> 01:13:17,030
<font size="64">- It must be true! - As for that...</font>

2851
01:13:17,160 --> 01:13:19,200
<font size="64">It must be true!</font>

2852
01:13:17,460 --> 01:13:20,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Fact checked)</font>

2853
01:13:19,330 --> 01:13:20,970
<font size="64">- As for that... - How could you do that?</font>

2854
01:13:20,830 --> 01:13:23,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He suddenly becomes the prime suspect.)</font>

2855
01:13:21,270 --> 01:13:23,300
<font size="64">- It wasn't my intention. - How could you do that?</font>

2856
01:13:23,300 --> 01:13:24,300
<font size="64">My goodness.</font>

2857
01:13:24,300 --> 01:13:25,340
<font size="64">- I mean... - I got goosebumps.</font>

2858
01:13:25,340 --> 01:13:26,570
<font size="64">- Bo Hyun, is it true? - It's him.</font>

2859
01:13:26,570 --> 01:13:28,440
<font size="64">- Listen to me. - Is it true?</font>

2860
01:13:26,570 --> 01:13:28,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jumping)</font>

2861
01:13:28,440 --> 01:13:30,680
<font size="64">It's true. But let me explain.</font>

2862
01:13:29,740 --> 01:13:32,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He hurriedly defends himself.)</font>

2863
01:13:30,910 --> 01:13:32,980
<font size="64">Jae Seok ripped off Se Chan's name tag...</font>

2864
01:13:33,110 --> 01:13:34,950
<font size="64">and took his hints.</font>

2865
01:13:35,180 --> 01:13:37,790
<font size="64">He didn't want to share the hints, so I took off his name tag.</font>

2866
01:13:35,520 --> 01:13:37,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The hint)</font>

2867
01:13:37,950 --> 01:13:39,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The undercover detective)</font>

2868
01:13:38,050 --> 01:13:40,050
<font size="64">- I'm not the spy. - He must've done that...</font>

2869
01:13:40,090 --> 01:13:43,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Suspicious)</font>

2870
01:13:40,190 --> 01:13:41,920
<font size="64">because he is on the same team...</font>

2871
01:13:41,920 --> 01:13:43,620
<font size="64">- as Se Chan. - What?</font>

2872
01:13:43,520 --> 01:13:47,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Is he the victimized tycoon or the undercover detective?)</font>

2873
01:13:43,660 --> 01:13:44,730
<font size="64">I'm not the spy.</font>

2874
01:13:46,230 --> 01:13:48,400
<font size="64">Hold on a second.</font>

2875
01:13:49,160 --> 01:13:50,660
<font size="64">- Jae Seok. - Did he rip off your name tag?</font>

2876
01:13:51,060 --> 01:13:54,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok knows about Chairman Ha's identity.)</font>

2877
01:13:51,060 --> 01:13:52,200
<font size="64">Did Bo Hyun rip off your name tag?</font>

2878
01:13:52,470 --> 01:13:53,670
<font size="64">Yes, he did.</font>

2879
01:13:53,670 --> 01:13:55,140
<font size="64">- I did that because you... - Jae Seok.</font>

2880
01:13:56,140 --> 01:13:59,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He finally meets Jae Seok, the brainy member!)</font>

2881
01:13:56,200 --> 01:13:57,240
<font size="64">How did it...</font>

2882
01:13:57,970 --> 01:13:59,110
<font size="64">Is it true?</font>

2883
01:13:59,370 --> 01:14:03,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(But they can't talk freely since the undercover detective is here.)</font>

2884
01:13:59,410 --> 01:14:00,440
<font size="64">Right now...</font>

2885
01:14:00,440 --> 01:14:01,910
<font size="64">- What? - You tried to hoard the hints.</font>

2886
01:14:02,910 --> 01:14:04,480
<font size="64">Jae Seok, we need to talk.</font>

2887
01:14:03,340 --> 01:14:05,610
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Secretive)</font>

2888
01:14:05,750 --> 01:14:09,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chairman Ha requests to talk with Jae Seok alone.)</font>

2889
01:14:06,050 --> 01:14:07,680
<font size="64">- We need to talk. - What?</font>

2890
01:14:08,020 --> 01:14:09,050
<font size="64">Hold on.</font>

2891
01:14:09,280 --> 01:14:10,550
<font size="64">- What is it? - I...</font>

2892
01:14:10,550 --> 01:14:12,320
<font size="64">I'm the chairman.</font>

2893
01:14:12,320 --> 01:14:13,920
<font size="64">- That's right. - So now,</font>

2894
01:14:14,320 --> 01:14:15,620
<font size="64">we need to escape.</font>

2895
01:14:15,620 --> 01:14:16,760
<font size="64">I'm certain that you aren't the spy...</font>

2896
01:14:16,760 --> 01:14:19,030
<font size="64">because you shared the hints with me.</font>

2897
01:14:17,460 --> 01:14:19,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Haha's deduction: Jae Seok isn't a spy because he shared...)</font>

2898
01:14:19,030 --> 01:14:20,690
<font size="64">- That's right. - You also found...</font>

2899
01:14:19,560 --> 01:14:22,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(an important with him and helped him succeed his mission.)</font>

2900
01:14:20,690 --> 01:14:22,300
<font size="64">- It's Bo Hyun. - I'm completely certain.</font>

2901
01:14:22,300 --> 01:14:23,730
<font size="64">Bo Hyun is the spy.</font>

2902
01:14:23,730 --> 01:14:25,900
<font size="64">- I told you that repeatedly. - Bo Hyun is the spy.</font>

2903
01:14:25,900 --> 01:14:29,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chairman Ha brings Jae Seok to the bomb room.)</font>

2904
01:14:25,900 --> 01:14:28,100
<font size="64">- Hurry up. - What do we need to do to escape?</font>

2905
01:14:28,100 --> 01:14:29,440
<font size="64">I'll tell you.</font>

2906
01:14:31,510 --> 01:14:32,570
<font size="64">What do we need to do to escape?</font>

2907
01:14:32,870 --> 01:14:35,210
<font size="64">I need to answer the questions correctly...</font>

2908
01:14:36,210 --> 01:14:37,280
<font size="64">To cut the wires?</font>

2909
01:14:37,280 --> 01:14:39,180
<font size="64">- To cut the wires. - What kind of questions?</font>

2910
01:14:39,180 --> 01:14:40,550
<font size="64">- They're so hard. - What kind of questions?</font>

2911
01:14:40,550 --> 01:14:43,180
<font size="64">Who wrote "Sapiens: A Brief History of Humankind?"</font>

2912
01:14:44,050 --> 01:14:47,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Correct)</font>

2913
01:14:44,120 --> 01:14:46,390
<font size="64">- Yuval Harari. - That's right. I got it wrong.</font>

2914
01:14:46,950 --> 01:14:49,020
<font size="64">- And... Was it Dabotap Pagoda? - For goodness' sake.</font>

2915
01:14:49,460 --> 01:14:52,230
<font size="64">The first book that was found inside the pagoda.</font>

2916
01:14:49,860 --> 01:14:53,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Clapping)</font>

2917
01:14:52,430 --> 01:14:55,330
<font size="64">- Okay. The Great Dharani Sutra. - That's right. I got it wrong.</font>

2918
01:14:53,160 --> 01:14:56,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Correct)</font>

2919
01:14:56,160 --> 01:14:58,100
<font size="64">- Gosh, you guys made him... - What was the other one?</font>

2920
01:14:57,200 --> 01:15:00,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Correct again)</font>

2921
01:14:58,100 --> 01:15:00,770
<font size="64">- the chairman on purpose. - What was the other one?</font>

2922
01:15:00,200 --> 01:15:03,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He is a lot worse than expected.)</font>

2923
01:15:00,770 --> 01:15:02,740
<font size="64">There was another one I got wrong. In any case, follow me.</font>

2924
01:15:03,140 --> 01:15:04,240
<font size="64">Which way is it?</font>

2925
01:15:05,310 --> 01:15:06,310
<font size="64">Be quiet.</font>

2926
01:15:06,770 --> 01:15:10,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chairman Ha gets himself a trustworthy helper.)</font>

2927
01:15:11,680 --> 01:15:12,850
<font size="64">- Is this the place? - Here.</font>

2928
01:15:13,910 --> 01:15:17,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He takes the smart one to the bomb room.)</font>

2929
01:15:14,350 --> 01:15:15,880
<font size="64">Jae Seok, hurry up.</font>

2930
01:15:16,080 --> 01:15:17,750
<font size="64">All right.</font>

2931
01:15:18,020 --> 01:15:21,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Desperate)</font>

2932
01:15:18,050 --> 01:15:19,190
<font size="64">We'll answer the questions.</font>

2933
01:15:19,450 --> 01:15:20,490
<font size="64">Please answer them.</font>

2934
01:15:20,490 --> 01:15:22,190
<font size="64">You cut the wrong wire before.</font>

2935
01:15:22,460 --> 01:15:24,660
<font size="64">Because of that, five wires have been added.</font>

2936
01:15:22,890 --> 01:15:24,190
