01:20:25,490 --> 01:20:26,960
<font size="64">- Cut number 9. - Number 9?</font>

3132
01:20:26,960 --> 01:20:29,300
<font size="64">We got it now.</font>

3133
01:20:27,130 --> 01:20:30,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He cuts off Wire 9, the final real bomb wire.)</font>

3134
01:20:30,100 --> 01:20:32,100
<font size="64">We're going to get rich now!</font>

3135
01:20:34,370 --> 01:20:38,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The bomb is defused.)</font>

3136
01:20:35,140 --> 01:20:36,940
<font size="64">- Did it work? - The bomb has been defused.</font>

3137
01:20:36,940 --> 01:20:38,710
<font size="64">I'll tell you the passcode.</font>

3138
01:20:38,710 --> 01:20:40,240
<font size="64">It's 720814.</font>

3139
01:20:38,770 --> 01:20:43,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The briefcase's passcode is 720814.)</font>

3140
01:20:40,240 --> 01:20:42,040
<font size="64">It's 720814.</font>

3141
01:20:42,210 --> 01:20:43,610
<font size="64">Should I open it?</font>

3142
01:20:44,010 --> 01:20:46,150
<font size="64">Isn't that my birthday?</font>

3143
01:20:46,480 --> 01:20:48,110
<font size="64">- What? - He...</font>

3144
01:20:48,110 --> 01:20:49,980
<font size="64">- I'm the chairman. - He's the chairman.</font>

3145
01:20:51,480 --> 01:20:54,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Dissatisfied)</font>

3146
01:20:51,750 --> 01:20:54,690
<font size="64">Did you assume I'll be the one answering the questions?</font>

3147
01:20:55,290 --> 01:20:58,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Still, only the chairman can open the money briefcase.)</font>

3148
01:20:55,590 --> 01:20:56,960
<font size="64">Seven, two...</font>

3149
01:21:00,330 --> 01:21:02,200
<font size="64">- Seven, two. - Two.</font>

3150
01:21:02,600 --> 01:21:03,700
<font size="64">Zero, eight, one, four.</font>

3151
01:21:03,830 --> 01:21:06,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Opening the briefcase)</font>

3152
01:21:07,470 --> 01:21:10,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They get cash and a car key.)</font>

3153
01:21:09,040 --> 01:21:10,240
<font size="64">There's a car as well!</font>

3154
01:21:10,240 --> 01:21:11,970
<font size="64">We're leaving in this car.</font>

3155
01:21:10,540 --> 01:21:12,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Immersed)</font>

3156
01:21:12,110 --> 01:21:13,510
<font size="64">Hold on. Where's the car?</font>

3157
01:21:13,840 --> 01:21:15,480
<font size="64">You have to find the car.</font>

3158
01:21:14,210 --> 01:21:17,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(For Team Flex to win, he must find the car and leave with the tycoons.)</font>

3159
01:21:15,480 --> 01:21:19,410
<font size="64">You have to get all your team members in the car and leave.</font>

3160
01:21:17,280 --> 01:21:19,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(But they lose if they bring the undercover detective with them.)</font>

3161
01:21:19,410 --> 01:21:22,220
<font size="64">I'll get in the car and start the engine.</font>

3162
01:21:21,510 --> 01:21:24,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(That's ridiculous.)</font>

3163
01:21:22,220 --> 01:21:23,950
<font size="64">- You can bring everyone to the car. - What?</font>

3164
01:21:24,620 --> 01:21:27,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He wants to leave all the work to Jae Seok until the end.)</font>

3165
01:21:24,780 --> 01:21:27,090
<font size="64">- The answers were... - You...</font>

3166
01:21:27,090 --> 01:21:28,860
<font size="64">- So you... - The chairman...</font>

3167
01:21:28,860 --> 01:21:30,960
<font size="64">- What do you actually do? - I'm the chairman.</font>

3168
01:21:31,960 --> 01:21:33,130
<font size="64">I'm the chairman!</font>

3169
01:21:33,390 --> 01:21:37,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The figurehead chairman abuses his title.)</font>

3170
01:21:33,590 --> 01:21:36,960
<font size="64">You're only a tycoon. You should serve the chairman.</font>

3171
01:21:37,460 --> 01:21:41,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Regardless, Jae Seok must take him to escape.)</font>

3172
01:21:37,930 --> 01:21:41,200
<font size="64">Goodness. Hold on, then the car...</font>

3173
01:21:41,870 --> 01:21:44,440
<font size="64">Then I should bring everyone except Bo Hyun.</font>

3174
01:21:44,700 --> 01:21:48,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They still suspect Bo Hyun of being the undercover detective.)</font>

3175
01:21:44,740 --> 01:21:47,470
<font size="64">- Why did Bo Hyun rip off yours? - Exactly.</font>

3176
01:21:47,470 --> 01:21:50,980
<font size="64">Bo Hyun made a suggestion when he got in the van.</font>

3177
01:21:48,240 --> 01:21:53,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If they run away with Seok Sam, Team Flex loses.)</font>

3178
01:21:50,980 --> 01:21:52,480
<font size="64">Does that even make sense?</font>

3179
01:21:53,810 --> 01:21:56,250
<font size="64">- Let's first head out. - The spy was right there.</font>

3180
01:21:56,380 --> 01:21:57,380
<font size="64">Let's first go out.</font>

3181
01:21:58,490 --> 01:22:01,420
<font size="64">What should I do? What should I do with this, Jae Seok?</font>

3182
01:22:01,450 --> 01:22:05,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The money briefcase is too noticeable.)</font>

3183
01:22:01,790 --> 01:22:02,960
<font size="64">Where should I hide it?</font>

3184
01:22:03,020 --> 01:22:04,290
<font size="64">Put it behind there.</font>

3185
01:22:11,330 --> 01:22:14,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He hides it out of sight.)</font>

3186
01:22:12,500 --> 01:22:13,500
<font size="64">Okay.</font>

3187
01:22:15,470 --> 01:22:19,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok heads out to gather the tycoons.)</font>

3188
01:22:17,140 --> 01:22:18,710
<font size="64">Who could the spy be?</font>

3189
01:22:19,470 --> 01:22:20,940
<font size="64">Jae Seok!</font>

3190
01:22:20,870 --> 01:22:24,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He encounters the fake tycoon.)</font>

3191
01:22:21,980 --> 01:22:23,010
<font size="64">Seok Sam.</font>

3192
01:22:23,880 --> 01:22:26,680
<font size="64">Jae Seok. Stay there.</font>

3193
01:22:26,680 --> 01:22:27,750
<font size="64">Stay there, Jae Seok.</font>

3194
01:22:32,250 --> 01:22:33,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Acting)</font>

3195
01:22:32,290 --> 01:22:33,520
<font size="64">Who's the spy?</font>

3196
01:22:33,950 --> 01:22:35,020
<font size="64">I don't know who the spy is.</font>

3197
01:22:35,020 --> 01:22:36,090
<font size="64">Isn't it Bo Hyun?</font>

3198
01:22:36,590 --> 01:22:38,960
<font size="64">- Aren't you the spy? - Come on. It's not me.</font>

3199
01:22:38,960 --> 01:22:40,460
<font size="64">- Aren't you the chairman? - I'm not.</font>

3200
01:22:40,460 --> 01:22:41,960
<font size="64">- The chairman... - Seok Jin.</font>

3201
01:22:42,360 --> 01:22:44,260
<font size="64">Why are you so curious about who the chairman is?</font>

3202
01:22:42,460 --> 01:22:44,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Suspicious)</font>

3203
01:22:44,960 --> 01:22:48,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Feeling guilty)</font>

3204
01:22:45,100 --> 01:22:47,100
<font size="64">Don't try to make me the spy. It's not me.</font>

3205
01:22:47,100 --> 01:22:48,970
<font size="64">I'm not trying to make you the spy.</font>

3206
01:22:48,970 --> 01:22:50,970
<font size="64">You've been looking for the chairman this whole time.</font>

3207
01:22:50,970 --> 01:22:53,770
<font size="64">- The chairman... - We should be looking...</font>

3208
01:22:53,840 --> 01:22:55,810
<font size="64">- for the spy. - That's Bo Hyun.</font>

3209
01:22:55,810 --> 01:22:58,710
<font size="64">Bo Hyun is the spy. Trust me.</font>

3210
01:22:59,150 --> 01:23:02,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Confused)</font>

3211
01:22:59,750 --> 01:23:02,550
<font size="64">I'm telling you. It's Bo Hyun.</font>

3212
01:23:03,180 --> 01:23:07,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(To the detectives)</font>

3213
01:23:03,350 --> 01:23:05,920
<font size="64">- Quickly find the handcuffs! - What?</font>

3214
01:23:05,920 --> 01:23:08,420
<font size="64">- Quickly find the handcuffs! - What?</font>

3215
01:23:08,490 --> 01:23:10,160
<font size="64">- Quickly find the handcuffs! - Yes?</font>

3216
01:23:09,260 --> 01:23:10,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Halts)</font>

3217
01:23:10,720 --> 01:23:11,760
<font size="64">- Seok Jin. - Yes?</font>

3218
01:23:11,760 --> 01:23:12,960
<font size="64">Did you just say "yes?"</font>

3219
01:23:13,090 --> 01:23:14,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Feigning ignorance)</font>

3220
01:23:13,230 --> 01:23:14,960
<font size="64">- What? - You...</font>

3221
01:23:14,590 --> 01:23:18,870
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The undercover detective unconsciously answered Jong Kook.)</font>

3222
01:23:14,960 --> 01:23:17,760
<font size="64">He told you to look for the handcuffs and you said "yes."</font>

3223
01:23:17,930 --> 01:23:20,230
<font size="64">- Hey... - Don't keep accusing me.</font>

3224
01:23:18,870 --> 01:23:21,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sweating)</font>

3225
01:23:20,230 --> 01:23:21,300
<font size="64">But...</font>

3226
01:23:21,300 --> 01:23:22,700
<font size="64">Don't make me look like the spy.</font>

3227
01:23:21,400 --> 01:23:25,840
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Please)</font>

3228
01:23:22,700 --> 01:23:24,600
<font size="64">He told you to look for the handcuffs and you said "yes."</font>

3229
01:23:25,670 --> 01:23:27,940
<font size="64">- I was just reacting. - I mean...</font>

3230
01:23:29,110 --> 01:23:31,380
<font size="64">- Why... - He's trying to pin it on me.</font>

3231
01:23:30,010 --> 01:23:34,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam had been hiding well. Will he be discovered now?)</font>

3232
01:23:31,380 --> 01:23:34,680
<font size="64">- I'm not. You're... - It's not me.</font>

3233
01:23:34,850 --> 01:23:36,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Meanwhile, Chairman Ha searches the parking lot.)</font>

3234
01:23:34,910 --> 01:23:36,520
<font size="64">Is it a Carnival?</font>

3235
01:23:36,850 --> 01:23:38,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Beep)</font>

3236
01:23:37,750 --> 01:23:39,820
<font size="64">It's over there.</font>

3237
01:23:39,820 --> 01:23:41,090
<font size="64">It's over there.</font>

3238
01:23:39,990 --> 01:23:43,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chairman Ha finds the getaway car.)</font>

3239
01:23:41,890 --> 01:23:44,460
<font size="64">Okay.</font>

3240
01:23:44,820 --> 01:23:47,130
<font size="64">The car is here.</font>

3241
01:23:44,960 --> 01:23:49,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Now he needs to get the briefcase and the tycoons in the car.)</font>

3242
01:23:49,330 --> 01:23:53,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(But first, he needs to identify the undercover detective.)</font>

3243
01:23:49,660 --> 01:23:52,600
<font size="64">I'll first put the briefcase in the car and lock it.</font>

3244
01:23:54,900 --> 01:23:55,900
<font size="64">Jae Seok!</font>

3245
01:23:56,500 --> 01:23:58,340
<font size="64">Haha.</font>

3246
01:23:58,240 --> 01:24:01,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He ignores Bo Hyun's urgent shouts.)</font>

3247
01:23:58,510 --> 01:24:00,640
<font size="64">- Hold on, Bo Hyun. - Haha!</font>

3248
01:24:00,770 --> 01:24:03,710
<font size="64">See me first. I know why you think it's me.</font>

3249
01:24:03,940 --> 01:24:06,380
<font size="64">- I... - Why did you rip the name tag?</font>

3250
01:24:05,080 --> 01:24:06,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The name tag)</font>

3251
01:24:07,510 --> 01:24:10,920
<font size="64">- I know why you think it's me. - Okay.</font>

3252
01:24:10,920 --> 01:24:13,350
<font size="64">I know what you are.</font>

3253
01:24:13,820 --> 01:24:15,890
<font size="64">- What? - You're the chairman.</font>

3254
01:24:15,890 --> 01:24:17,560
<font size="64">Why do you think it's me?</font>

3255
01:24:16,260 --> 01:24:18,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He knows Haha's identity!)</font>

3256
01:24:18,760 --> 01:24:22,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Lone wolf Bo Hyun found a crucial hint.)</font>

3257
01:24:22,600 --> 01:24:23,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The chairman's wife is a celebrity.)</font>

3258
01:24:23,230 --> 01:24:25,230
<font size="64">It's Haha.</font>

3259
01:24:23,900 --> 01:24:25,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Candidates: Yu Jae Seok, Haha, Kang Sang Jun)</font>

3260
01:24:25,200 --> 01:24:27,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chairman hint)</font>

3261
01:24:25,500 --> 01:24:27,330
<font size="64">It's Haha. It's definitely him.</font>

3262
01:24:27,270 --> 01:24:29,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He is sure that Haha is the chairman.)</font>

3263
01:24:27,470 --> 01:24:29,300
<font size="64">There's no one but Haha.</font>

3264
01:24:30,600 --> 01:24:32,310
<font size="64">You're the chairman.</font>

3265
01:24:32,170 --> 01:24:33,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Lying)</font>

3266
01:24:32,310 --> 01:24:33,340
<font size="64">I'm not.</font>

3267
01:24:33,510 --> 01:24:36,140
<font size="64">- Even now... - Seriously.</font>

3268
01:24:33,710 --> 01:24:36,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He is sure that Bo Hyun is the undercover detective.)</font>

3269
01:24:36,880 --> 01:24:38,240
<font size="64">What are you basing that on?</font>

3270
01:24:37,510 --> 01:24:40,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Upset)</font>

3271
01:24:38,240 --> 01:24:39,980
<font size="64">He's denying it to the very end.</font>

3272
01:24:40,150 --> 01:24:43,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The real tycoon is excluded until the end.)</font>

3273
01:24:40,650 --> 01:24:41,920
<font size="64">Seriously.</font>

3274
01:24:42,180 --> 01:24:43,620
<font size="64">Hold on. Come with me.</font>

3275
01:24:43,950 --> 01:24:46,290
<font size="64">- Haha! - Stay there for a bit, Bo Hyun.</font>

3276
01:24:46,850 --> 01:24:51,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Feeling lonely)</font>

3277
01:24:49,360 --> 01:24:50,490
<font size="64">Come on.</font>

3278
01:24:51,860 --> 01:24:53,660
<font size="64">- Give me the car key. - I found it.</font>

3279
01:24:53,490 --> 01:24:58,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He shares the car location, keeping it a secret from Bo Hyun.)</font>

3280
01:24:53,660 --> 01:24:55,730
<font size="64">- You did? Where is it? - It's outside.</font>

3281
01:24:55,760 --> 01:24:57,460
<font size="64">Go that way...</font>

3282
01:24:57,460 --> 01:24:58,870
<font size="64">You'll find the car.</font>

3283
01:24:59,870 --> 01:25:03,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(For Team Flex to win, Bo Hyun needs to get in the car.)</font>

3284
01:25:03,100 --> 01:25:05,510
<font size="64">I'll take the briefcase there.</font>

3285
01:25:05,510 --> 01:25:07,410
<font size="64">- Okay. - Bo Hyun...</font>

3286
01:25:07,410 --> 01:25:11,310
<font size="64">Honestly, you can't blame us for suspecting you.</font>

3287
01:25:11,310 --> 01:25:13,480
<font size="64">- You agree there, right? - But...</font>

3288
01:25:13,480 --> 01:25:15,620
<font size="64">why are you lying?</font>

3289
01:25:15,750 --> 01:25:16,980
<font size="64">I didn't lie.</font>

3290
01:25:17,450 --> 01:25:19,120
<font size="64">Could I talk to you for a moment, Sang Jun?</font>

3291
01:25:17,980 --> 01:25:21,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(This time, he excludes Bo Hyun and calls Sang Jun.)</font>

3292
01:25:22,190 --> 01:25:23,820
<font size="64">Don't regret later. I've put everything on the line.</font>

3293
01:25:23,820 --> 01:25:25,560
<font size="64">Regret what? Why are you threatening me?</font>

3294
01:25:25,560 --> 01:25:27,390
<font size="64">- It's scary. - It really isn't me.</font>

3295
01:25:27,390 --> 01:25:29,960
<font size="64">Why are you being so scary? "Don't regret later?"</font>

3296
01:25:27,890 --> 01:25:33,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will victory slip further away from Team Flex like this?)</font>

3297
01:25:30,130 --> 01:25:31,400
<font size="64">If you say that...</font>

3298
01:25:35,200 --> 01:25:37,770
<font size="64">I received the car key...</font>

3299
01:25:37,770 --> 01:25:40,370
<font size="64">- and found the car as well. - Okay.</font>

3300
01:25:39,640 --> 01:25:43,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He shares the information about the car to Sang Jun.)</font>

3301
01:25:40,840 --> 01:25:42,840
<font size="64">I'll move...</font>

3302
01:25:42,840 --> 01:25:45,750
<font size="64">the briefcase now. Find where the car is.</font>

3303
01:25:45,580 --> 01:25:48,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(An order from the chairman)</font>

3304
01:25:45,750 --> 01:25:47,410
<font size="64">We have to gather everyone except Bo Hyun.</font>

3305
01:25:47,510 --> 01:25:49,450
<font size="64">For now, wait here.</font>

3306
01:25:49,450 --> 01:25:51,020
<font size="64">Okay. Where's the car?</font>

3307
01:25:51,020 --> 01:25:53,690
<font size="64">- It's right there. - Okay.</font>

3308
01:25:54,390 --> 01:25:59,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chairman Ha plans to move the money briefcase first.)</font>

3309
01:25:56,490 --> 01:25:58,090
<font size="64">I'll take the briefcase.</font>

3310
01:25:59,960 --> 01:26:01,930
<font size="64">Quickly look for the handcuffs.</font>

3311
01:26:00,160 --> 01:26:03,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Detective is busy looking for the handcuffs.)</font>

3312
01:26:03,360 --> 01:26:05,470
<font size="64">I found them!</font>

3313
01:26:03,860 --> 01:26:07,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Detective Kook obtains the handcuffs.)</font>

3314
01:26:06,500 --> 01:26:07,970
<font size="64">Look for them quickly.</font>

3315
01:26:08,670 --> 01:26:11,270
<font size="64">It's so obvious. I have no choice now.</font>

3316
01:26:11,870 --> 01:26:13,110
<font size="64">I found them.</font>

3317
01:26:13,310 --> 01:26:16,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ye Eun also found the handcuffs.)</font>

3318
01:26:15,610 --> 01:26:16,710
<font size="64">Awesome!</font>

3319
01:26:17,580 --> 01:26:18,580
<font size="64">Awesome.</font>

3320
01:26:19,010 --> 01:26:21,280
<font size="64">I'll walk quickly. Stay far away from me.</font>

3321
01:26:19,050 --> 01:26:23,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Detective is very close to finding all the handcuffs.)</font>

3322
01:26:21,950 --> 01:26:22,980
<font size="64">Are there many people there?</font>

3323
01:26:24,950 --> 01:26:26,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Running)</font>

3324
01:26:27,950 --> 01:26:31,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chairman Ha goes to the car while no one is around.)</font>

3325
01:26:36,000 --> 01:26:40,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He managed to bring the money briefcase without getting caught.)</font>

3326
01:26:45,670 --> 01:26:47,940
<font size="64">Okay. This...</font>

3327
01:26:49,040 --> 01:26:52,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The money briefcase)</font>

3328
01:26:49,210 --> 01:26:51,780
<font size="64">I'll keep this here. I have to get back inside now.</font>

3329
01:26:52,050 --> 01:26:53,750
<font size="64">Let's head back.</font>

3330
01:26:53,950 --> 01:26:58,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(All that's left is gathering the tycoons in the car.)</font>

3331
01:26:54,110 --> 01:26:55,950
<font size="64">Sang Jun.</font>

3332
01:26:57,480 --> 01:26:59,990
<font size="64">It's a Hyundai car. Plate number 5201.</font>

3333
01:26:58,550 --> 01:27:00,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He shares the car plate number.)</font>

3334
01:26:59,990 --> 01:27:01,990
<font size="64">- Plate number 5201. - Tell everyone to come outside.</font>

3335
01:27:01,990 --> 01:27:03,220
<font size="64">I'll take them.</font>

3336
01:27:03,220 --> 01:27:05,120
<font size="64">Plate number 5201. I'll get the engine started.</font>

3337
01:27:06,460 --> 01:27:10,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sang Jun leaves with the chairman's orders.)</font>

3338
01:27:06,960 --> 01:27:08,760
<font size="64">You know who to leave behind, right?</font>

3339
01:27:10,200 --> 01:27:12,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Urgent)</font>

3340
01:27:10,230 --> 01:27:13,500
<font size="64">Hurry, hurry! We don't have much time.</font>

3341
01:27:13,130 --> 01:27:19,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will Team Flex escape first, or will Team Detective arrest them?)</font>

3342
01:27:14,370 --> 01:27:15,500
<font size="64">Hurry, Sang Jun!</font>

3343
01:27:15,970 --> 01:27:18,710
<font size="64">We're looking for an opportunity to escape.</font>

3344
01:27:18,710 --> 01:27:19,870
<font size="64">Hurry!</font>

3345
01:27:20,410 --> 01:27:22,310
<font size="64">Handcuffs!</font>

3346
01:27:22,310 --> 01:27:23,540
<font size="64">- Did you find them? - Yes.</font>

3347
01:27:23,610 --> 01:27:24,640
<font size="64">Did you find them?</font>

3348
01:27:24,910 --> 01:27:29,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Detective members gather with the handcuffs.)</font>

3349
01:27:26,050 --> 01:27:28,950
<font size="64">Okay. Then first... Where are the handcuffs, Ye Eun?</font>

3350
01:27:29,650 --> 01:27:32,020
<font size="64">You have them there. Okay, then first...</font>

3351
01:27:32,020 --> 01:27:33,290
<font size="64">Once the undercover detective...</font>

3352
01:27:33,290 --> 01:27:34,990
<font size="64">- finds the handcuffs, - Did he find them?</font>

3353
01:27:34,990 --> 01:27:36,860
<font size="64">that's all of them. Only Se Chan hasn't found them.</font>

3354
01:27:36,860 --> 01:27:38,290
<font size="64">- Se Chan? - Se Chan is suspicious.</font>

3355
01:27:38,290 --> 01:27:39,960
<font size="64">Se Chan is suspicious.</font>

3356
01:27:40,290 --> 01:27:41,560
<font size="64">I'm looking for them!</font>

3357
01:27:42,100 --> 01:27:44,160
<font size="64">- Where is he? - I'm looking for them, Jong Kook.</font>

3358
01:27:44,860 --> 01:27:47,930
<font size="64">Why do you keep excluding me?</font>

3359
01:27:49,370 --> 01:27:51,500
<font size="64">I'm on the same team too. I'm a detective!</font>

3360
01:27:51,500 --> 01:27:54,770
<font size="64">Se Chan is suspicious.</font>

3361
01:27:54,770 --> 01:27:56,710
<font size="64">- And... - I think it's him.</font>

3362
01:27:56,710 --> 01:27:59,450
<font size="64">The undercover detective needs to find the handcuffs.</font>

3363
01:27:57,980 --> 01:27:59,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They exclude Se Chan...)</font>

3364
01:27:59,850 --> 01:28:01,480
<font size="64">The undercover detective needs to find the handcuffs.</font>

3365
01:27:59,980 --> 01:28:01,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(and try to look for a handcuff for the undercover detective.)</font>

3366
01:28:01,880 --> 01:28:04,820
<font size="64">Let's quickly find a pair of handcuffs and give them to Seok Jin.</font>

3367
01:28:05,220 --> 01:28:06,650
<font size="64">Let's look for them.</font>

3368
01:28:06,950 --> 01:28:09,590
<font size="64">I need to decide now. Will I go out with them...</font>

3369
01:28:08,450 --> 01:28:09,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(For Team Detective to win,)</font>

3370
01:28:09,990 --> 01:28:11,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(they must find all the handcuffs and arrest Haha,)</font>

3371
01:28:10,120 --> 01:28:11,190
<font size="64">or...</font>

3372
01:28:11,560 --> 01:28:15,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(or Seok Jin, the undercover cop, must leave with Haha in the car.)</font>

3373
01:28:11,760 --> 01:28:14,390
<font size="64">will I arrest the chairman?</font>

3374
01:28:15,230 --> 01:28:16,360
<font size="64">I have to decide.</font>

3375
01:28:17,030 --> 01:28:21,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chairman Ha is waiting in the car to avoid getting arrested.)</font>

3376
01:28:21,970 --> 01:28:25,670
<font size="64">I'll act like I'm looking for hints around here and deliver the message.</font>

3377
01:28:22,000 --> 01:28:25,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sang Jun is gathering the other tycoons.)</font>

3378
01:28:27,510 --> 01:28:31,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He runs into Seok Sam, the undercover cop, by chance.)</font>

3379
01:28:27,510 --> 01:28:28,570
<font size="64">Can I talk to you for a moment?</font>

3380
01:28:28,570 --> 01:28:31,040
<font size="64">Why? Okay, let's talk. I love people who want to talk to me.</font>

3381
01:28:31,040 --> 01:28:33,410
<font size="64">There's a Hyundai with plate number 2501 in the parking lot.</font>

3382
01:28:31,710 --> 01:28:35,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He tells him the plate number right away.)</font>

3383
01:28:33,410 --> 01:28:35,680
<font size="64">There's a Hyundai with plate number 2501 in the parking lot.</font>

3384
01:28:35,580 --> 01:28:40,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He revealed the car plate number to the undercover detective.)</font>

3385
01:28:36,380 --> 01:28:37,980
<font size="64">- We're leaving? - Let's escape.</font>

3386
01:28:37,980 --> 01:28:39,390
<font size="64">- Okay. Let's go. - Ji Hyo and...</font>

3387
01:28:39,390 --> 01:28:41,220
<font size="64">- Excluding Bo Hyun. - Excluding Bo Hyun.</font>

3388
01:28:40,520 --> 01:28:43,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Nice.)</font>

3389
01:28:41,220 --> 01:28:43,220
<font size="64">- Ji Hyo and... - Okay.</font>

3390
01:28:43,220 --> 01:28:45,190
<font size="64">- Number 2501? - Yes.</font>

3391
01:28:43,460 --> 01:28:46,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He obtained the crucial information for Team Detective to win.)</font>

3392
01:28:45,190 --> 01:28:46,560
<font size="64">- That way. - Okay.</font>

3393
01:28:46,960 --> 01:28:48,700
<font size="64">Where is Ji Hyo?</font>

3394
01:28:47,760 --> 01:28:52,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If they escape with Seok Sam, Team Flex will lose.)</font>

3395
01:28:48,860 --> 01:28:50,130
<font size="64">- What? - Where is Ji Hyo?</font>

3396
01:28:50,130 --> 01:28:51,400
<font size="64">Ji Hyo is right there. Ji Hyo!</font>

3397
01:28:51,730 --> 01:28:53,570
<font size="64">Just take Ji Hyo with you.</font>

3398
01:28:53,630 --> 01:28:56,840
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ji Hyo, who was searching, joins them too.)</font>

3399
01:28:54,470 --> 01:28:56,300
<font size="64">What is it?</font>

3400
01:28:56,500 --> 01:28:58,470
<font size="64">Come here. Hurry, Ji Hyo.</font>

3401
01:28:56,900 --> 01:29:00,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They must get Bo Hyun in the car instead of Seok Sam.)</font>

3402
01:28:58,470 --> 01:29:01,970
<font size="64">- We're escaping. - We're escaping.</font>

3403
01:29:01,970 --> 01:29:04,680
<font size="64">What? Where are you going? Hey!</font>

3404
01:29:04,310 --> 01:29:08,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Bo Hyun the real tycoon chases them when he sees them escape.)</font>

3405
01:29:04,680 --> 01:29:07,450
<font size="64">Where are you going, you fools? Where are you going?</font>

3406
01:29:08,110 --> 01:29:10,580
<font size="64">- Hurry up! - But Jae Seok has to come.</font>

3407
01:29:10,580 --> 01:29:13,190
<font size="64">There's a detective among us!</font>

3408
01:29:13,190 --> 01:29:15,150
<font size="64">Who? That's Bo Hyun!</font>

3409
01:29:15,290 --> 01:29:17,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Where are you going without me?)</font>

3410
01:29:15,390 --> 01:29:16,660
<font size="64">Where are you going?</font>

3411
01:29:17,390 --> 01:29:19,230
<font size="64">You shouldn't escape now!</font>

3412
01:29:19,560 --> 01:29:22,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Until the end)</font>

3413
01:29:19,660 --> 01:29:21,490
<font size="64">- It's Bo Hyun. - Where are you going?</font>

3414
01:29:21,490 --> 01:29:22,560
<font size="64">It's Bo Hyun!</font>

3415
01:29:23,500 --> 01:29:24,500
<font size="64">Hey!</font>

3416
01:29:23,860 --> 01:29:26,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Here!)</font>

3417
01:29:25,200 --> 01:29:26,200
<font size="64">Here!</font>

3418
01:29:27,200 --> 01:29:29,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If they leave with Seok Sam,)</font>

3419
01:29:27,600 --> 01:29:28,630
<font size="64">Okay.</font>

3420
01:29:28,940 --> 01:29:30,140
<font size="64">- Get in. - Number 5201.</font>

3421
01:29:29,670 --> 01:29:32,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Flex loses.)</font>

3422
01:29:30,140 --> 01:29:32,310
<font size="64">Hurry. Bo Hyun shouldn't get in the car.</font>

3423
01:29:32,310 --> 01:29:34,070
<font size="64">Jae Seok should...</font>

3424
01:29:34,140 --> 01:29:36,610
<font size="64">- If so many of us... - Goodness.</font>

3425
01:29:34,410 --> 01:29:38,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Undercover detective Seok Jin gets in the car.)</font>

3426
01:29:36,610 --> 01:29:39,010
<font size="64">- What is it? - We need to get in the car quickly!</font>

3427
01:29:39,410 --> 01:29:41,610
<font size="64">- Where are you going? - Bo Hyun shouldn't get in the car.</font>

3428
01:29:42,220 --> 01:29:43,950
<font size="64">- Not Bo Hyun. Lock the doors. - No!</font>

3429
01:29:43,950 --> 01:29:46,550
<font size="64">- Lock the door. - How could you let him catch you?</font>

3430
01:29:46,550 --> 01:29:47,690
<font size="64">But...</font>

3431
01:29:47,850 --> 01:29:49,360
<font size="64">- Se Chan. - Yes?</font>

3432
01:29:48,190 --> 01:29:51,290
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Meanwhile, the detectives...)</font>

3433
01:29:49,360 --> 01:29:51,420
<font size="64">- Have you not found the handcuffs? - I haven't found them yet.</font>

3434
01:29:51,490 --> 01:29:53,290
<font size="64">Could I search your bag to make sure?</font>

3435
01:29:53,290 --> 01:29:54,760
<font size="64">- What? - Your bag.</font>

3436
01:29:53,760 --> 01:29:56,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They check Ssaebssaeb's bag,)</font>

3437
01:29:54,860 --> 01:29:56,400
<font size="64">He might have found the handcuffs...</font>

3438
01:29:56,160 --> 01:29:58,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(who is suspected of being the undercover secretary.)</font>

3439
01:29:56,400 --> 01:29:57,400
<font size="64">You know, he suddenly said,</font>

3440
01:29:57,400 --> 01:29:58,830
<font size="64">- "Ji Ye Eun..." - We need to find the handcuffs.</font>

3441
01:29:58,830 --> 01:29:59,930
<font size="64">- "Jong Kook is suspicious." - Look at this!</font>

3442
01:29:59,600 --> 01:30:03,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Is Ssaebssaeb really Team Flex's undercover secretary?)</font>

3443
01:29:59,930 --> 01:30:01,370
<font size="64">- It's... - We...</font>

3444
01:30:01,370 --> 01:30:03,600
<font size="64">- It was very... - We need to check.</font>

3445
01:30:03,600 --> 01:30:04,900
<font size="64">- Why do this in front of them? - He...</font>

3446
01:30:04,900 --> 01:30:06,670
<font size="64">- Jong Kook. - I have to search you.</font>

3447
01:30:06,470 --> 01:30:08,610
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Removing his cap)</font>

3448
01:30:06,670 --> 01:30:07,710
<font size="64">- Shin Bi. - Jong Kook.</font>

3449
01:30:07,710 --> 01:30:09,310
<font size="64">- Why you... - Let's search...</font>

3450
01:30:08,610 --> 01:30:09,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Removing his name tag)</font>

3451
01:30:09,310 --> 01:30:10,710
<font size="64">Search him now.</font>

3452
01:30:09,910 --> 01:30:12,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(After making a mess out of him, they search his body.)</font>

3453
01:30:10,940 --> 01:30:13,010
<font size="64">They're not here. This guy...</font>

3454
01:30:13,010 --> 01:30:14,710
<font size="64">- What are you doing? - You...</font>

3455
01:30:14,710 --> 01:30:16,620
<font size="64">- It's not me! - It's not Bo Hyun!</font>

3456
01:30:14,810 --> 01:30:18,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Meanwhile, Team Flex is having a standoff in front of the car.)</font>

3457
01:30:16,750 --> 01:30:18,580
<font size="64">It's not me!</font>

3458
01:30:18,580 --> 01:30:19,790
<font size="64">- Goodness. - Goodness.</font>

3459
01:30:19,590 --> 01:30:22,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Anxious)</font>

3460
01:30:19,790 --> 01:30:22,390
<font size="64">- What's wrong with Ji Hyo? - What is she doing?</font>

3461
01:30:22,960 --> 01:30:24,520
<font size="64">- What? - Jae Seok.</font>

3462
01:30:23,320 --> 01:30:26,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(At that moment, Jae Seok joins them too.)</font>

3463
01:30:25,120 --> 01:30:26,960
<font size="64">- Jae Seok is here. - This is driving me crazy.</font>

3464
01:30:26,960 --> 01:30:29,460
<font size="64">Haha, the detective is in the car.</font>

3465
01:30:29,460 --> 01:30:31,860
<font size="64">- Bo Hyun is the detective. - This is so frustrating.</font>

3466
01:30:31,860 --> 01:30:33,230
<font size="64">- He is... - The hint I found says...</font>

3467
01:30:33,230 --> 01:30:34,830
<font size="64">- Bo Hyun is not the detective. - What's the hint?</font>

3468
01:30:34,830 --> 01:30:36,240
<font size="64">- Hurry and get in. - What does it say?</font>

3469
01:30:36,370 --> 01:30:38,600
<font size="64">The undercover detective is married.</font>

3470
01:30:38,600 --> 01:30:40,140
<font size="64">- It's not me. - What?</font>

3471
01:30:40,140 --> 01:30:42,010
<font size="64">The undercover detective is married.</font>

3472
01:30:40,540 --> 01:30:43,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The undercover detective is about to get caught!)</font>

3473
01:30:42,010 --> 01:30:44,210
<font size="64">- It's not me. - What?</font>

3474
01:30:43,710 --> 01:30:46,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ji Hyo found the hint right before they got in the car.)</font>

3475
01:30:44,210 --> 01:30:46,410
<font size="64">- Undercover detective is married. - It's not me.</font>

3476
01:30:46,380 --> 01:30:48,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The undercover detective is married.)</font>

3477
01:30:49,350 --> 01:30:51,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Unmarried)</font>

3478
01:30:49,420 --> 01:30:50,620
<font size="64">Bo Hyun is ruled out.</font>

3479
01:30:51,450 --> 01:30:53,250
<font size="64">The undercover detective is married.</font>

3480
01:30:53,250 --> 01:30:54,320
<font size="64">Is it Seok Jin?</font>

3481
01:30:54,550 --> 01:30:55,690
<font size="64">What does it mean that he's married?</font>

3482
01:30:55,860 --> 01:30:57,060
<font size="64">Hang on. Drag Seok Jin out.</font>

3483
01:30:56,060 --> 01:30:58,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They discovered the detective right before the escape.)</font>

3484
01:30:57,060 --> 01:30:58,120
<font size="64">- It's not you? - Wait.</font>

3485
01:30:58,160 --> 01:31:00,130
<font size="64">- Jee Seok Jin? Come on out. - It's not me!</font>

3486
01:30:58,420 --> 01:31:01,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Detective Seok Sam decides to hunker down.)</font>

3487
01:31:00,390 --> 01:31:01,960
<font size="64">- It's not me! - Is it Seok Jin?</font>

3488
01:31:01,190 --> 01:31:03,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He can't believe it.)</font>

3489
01:31:01,960 --> 01:31:03,660
<font size="64">- It's not me! - Is it Seok Jin?</font>

3490
01:31:03,900 --> 01:31:05,570
<font size="64">- It's Seok Jin. - No!</font>

3491
01:31:05,570 --> 01:31:07,600
<font size="64">- I said he was strange. - What does that mean?</font>

3492
01:31:07,600 --> 01:31:08,600
<font size="64">- Come on out. - Get out.</font>

3493
01:31:07,870 --> 01:31:10,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Struggling)</font>

3494
01:31:08,600 --> 01:31:10,270
<font size="64">- What does that hint mean? - Just drag him out.</font>

3495
01:31:10,270 --> 01:31:11,970
<font size="64">- Lift him. - What does that mean?</font>

3496
01:31:10,470 --> 01:31:14,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam, who's been married for 27 years, refuses to move.)</font>

3497
01:31:11,970 --> 01:31:14,270
<font size="64">- What does that mean? - Drag him out. Hurry.</font>

3498
01:31:14,270 --> 01:31:15,510
<font size="64">What does that mean?</font>

3499
01:31:14,440 --> 01:31:17,740
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They try to drag him out by force.)</font>

3500
01:31:15,540 --> 01:31:17,910
<font size="64">I said Seok Jin was strange.</font>

3501
01:31:17,740 --> 01:31:21,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He tries to contact Team Detective.)</font>

3502
01:31:17,910 --> 01:31:19,550
<font size="64">- What do you mean? - He's making a call.</font>

3503
01:31:19,650 --> 01:31:21,210
<font size="64">- He's calling them. - Get him out.</font>

3504
01:31:21,780 --> 01:31:23,480
<font size="64">- This is... - His shoes.</font>

3505
01:31:21,980 --> 01:31:27,290
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They miss his emergency call as they're busy searching Ssaebssaeb.)</font>

3506
01:31:23,480 --> 01:31:24,580
<font size="64">Take off your shoes.</font>

3507
01:31:24,580 --> 01:31:26,920
<font size="64">- Take them off. - Is this your belly?</font>

3508
01:31:26,920 --> 01:31:28,490
<font size="64">- This is my belly. - There's nothing.</font>

3509
01:31:28,490 --> 01:31:29,690
<font size="64">- He's calling them. - Get him out.</font>

3510
01:31:29,690 --> 01:31:31,660
<font size="64">- Good. We ripped it off. - You got it off.</font>

3511
01:31:30,120 --> 01:31:33,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(His name tag is removed!)</font>

3512
01:31:31,660 --> 01:31:33,690
<font size="64">- You're the detective. - No.</font>

3513
01:31:33,690 --> 01:31:35,460
<font size="64">- What does the hint mean? - Come on out.</font>

3514
01:31:34,360 --> 01:31:38,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He cannot move for 3 minutes.)</font>

3515
