3518
01:31:40,430 --> 01:31:41,730
<font size="64">Drag Seok Jin out.</font>

3519
01:31:41,900 --> 01:31:43,970
<font size="64">- What does the hint mean? - Drag him out.</font>

3520
01:31:44,040 --> 01:31:45,140
<font size="64">It's not me!</font>

3521
01:31:45,170 --> 01:31:46,510
<font size="64">- Hurry. - No!</font>

3522
01:31:47,210 --> 01:31:48,670
<font size="64">Just get in.</font>

3523
01:31:47,940 --> 01:31:50,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Bo Hyun overcomes his bitterness and showcases his strength.)</font>

3524
01:31:48,670 --> 01:31:50,180
<font size="64">- Get him out. - Hang on.</font>

3525
01:31:50,180 --> 01:31:51,940
<font size="64">- It's not me! - Hang on.</font>

3526
01:31:52,080 --> 01:31:54,250
<font size="64">- Hurry and get in. - What does that mean?</font>

3527
01:31:53,750 --> 01:31:56,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Flex starts the car after kicking out the detectie.)</font>

3528
01:31:54,410 --> 01:31:55,620
<font size="64">- Guys! - Ditch him.</font>

3529
01:31:55,620 --> 01:31:57,750
<font size="64">- You're being fooled. - Kick him.</font>

3530
01:31:57,820 --> 01:31:58,820
<font size="64">Don't move.</font>

3531
01:31:58,820 --> 01:32:00,550
<font size="64">- Guys! - Seok Jin, you're halted.</font>

3532
01:32:00,590 --> 01:32:01,690
<font size="64">Guys!</font>

3533
01:32:01,690 --> 01:32:04,020
<font size="64">- Hurry and come here. - Guys!</font>

3534
01:32:04,020 --> 01:32:05,460
<font size="64">- Get in quickly. - Hey, hurry.</font>

3535
01:32:04,320 --> 01:32:08,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Flex wins if they leave before Team Detective arrives.)</font>

3536
01:32:05,460 --> 01:32:07,030
<font size="64">- Buckle up. - We got this.</font>

3537
01:32:07,030 --> 01:32:08,960
<font size="64">- Jong Kook! - Buckle up.</font>

3538
01:32:08,960 --> 01:32:10,100
<font size="64">That fool.</font>

3539
01:32:10,230 --> 01:32:11,430
<font size="64">Here!</font>

3540
01:32:10,260 --> 01:32:13,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(While he can't do anything without being able to move!)</font>

3541
01:32:13,400 --> 01:32:15,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Flex's car drives away.)</font>

3542
01:32:14,170 --> 01:32:15,230
<font size="64">Buckle up.</font>

3543
01:32:15,230 --> 01:32:16,440
<font size="64">- My goodness. - Seatbelt.</font>

3544
01:32:16,870 --> 01:32:18,340
<font size="64">- If it weren't for Ji Hyo... - We did it.</font>

3545
01:32:18,340 --> 01:32:20,170
<font size="64">Song Ji Hyo did it.</font>

3546
01:32:20,170 --> 01:32:21,170
<font size="64">- Bo Hyun. - Yes.</font>

3547
01:32:21,170 --> 01:32:22,710
<font size="64">Why were you acting so suspiciously?</font>

3548
01:32:21,370 --> 01:32:25,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Thanks to Ji Hyo's crucial hint, Team Flex escapes successfully.)</font>

3549
01:32:22,710 --> 01:32:23,980
<font size="64">- What was that? - Why did you do that?</font>

3550
01:32:23,980 --> 01:32:26,850
<font size="64">Team Flex successfully escaped with the money briefcase.</font>

3551
01:32:26,680 --> 01:32:30,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Flex wins.)</font>

3552
01:32:29,750 --> 01:32:31,450
