3553
01:32:31,450 --> 01:32:32,750
<font size="64">failed to arrest the chairman,</font>

3554
01:32:32,750 --> 01:32:34,120
<font size="64">so they will receive the penalty.</font>

3555
01:32:34,120 --> 01:32:35,790
<font size="64">Now, Team Detective...</font>

3556
01:32:35,790 --> 01:32:37,820
