3559
01:32:44,700 --> 01:32:46,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The undercover secretary)</font>

3560
01:32:44,760 --> 01:32:45,800
<font size="64">It's Se Chan.</font>

3561
01:32:47,030 --> 01:32:48,400
<font size="64">We all found this.</font>

3562
01:32:47,370 --> 01:32:48,970
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ye Eun thinks Se Chan is the secretary...)</font>

3563
01:32:48,400 --> 01:32:50,040
<font size="64">- Is it her? - Seriously, it's not me.</font>

3564
01:32:48,970 --> 01:32:50,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(because he didn't find any handcuff.)</font>

3565
01:32:50,300 --> 01:32:51,500
<font size="64">- But... - Is it you?</font>

3566
01:32:51,540 --> 01:32:52,540
<font size="64">What?</font>

3567
01:32:52,570 --> 01:32:54,510
<font size="64">I got cleaned out, you know.</font>

3568
01:32:54,510 --> 01:32:55,680
<font size="64">Isn't it him?</font>

3569
01:32:55,680 --> 01:32:56,910
<font size="64">It's Se Chan.</font>

3570
01:32:56,910 --> 01:32:57,980
<font size="64">Is it her?</font>

3571
01:32:57,980 --> 01:32:59,080
<font size="64">- It could be her. - It's not me.</font>

3572
01:32:59,080 --> 01:33:01,010
<font size="64">- I'm serious. - I kept saying it was Haha,</font>

3573
01:33:01,010 --> 01:33:02,080
<font size="64">but she disagreed.</font>

3574
01:33:02,080 --> 01:33:04,250
<font size="64">I think we should rule out Ji Hyo and Haha.</font>

3575
01:33:04,650 --> 01:33:06,120
<font size="64">- I don't think so. - It's not Ji Hyo and Haha.</font>

3576
01:33:06,150 --> 01:33:07,450
<font size="64">- Haha... - These three.</font>

3577
01:33:07,590 --> 01:33:08,850
<font size="64">It could be Haha.</font>

3578
01:33:07,890 --> 01:33:11,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jong Kook thinks she knew about Chairman Ha and covered for him.)</font>

3579
01:33:08,850 --> 01:33:09,960
<font size="64">I don't think it's Haha.</font>

3580
01:33:12,020 --> 01:33:13,690
<font size="64">- It's just that I had bad judgment. - Is it over once we get it right?</font>

3581
01:33:13,690 --> 01:33:15,230
<font size="64">- I think she's blushing. - Today...</font>

3582
01:33:15,230 --> 01:33:16,260
<font size="64">- My face is always red. - Hey.</font>

3583
01:33:15,700 --> 01:33:19,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ye Eun has suddenly become the prime suspect.)</font>

3584
01:33:16,260 --> 01:33:17,530
<font size="64">I think it's her.</font>

3585
01:33:17,530 --> 01:33:18,860
<font size="64">- It's Ye Eun. - Jong Kook, I'm telling you.</font>

3586
01:33:19,470 --> 01:33:20,900
<font size="64">I think it's Jong Kook.</font>

3587
01:33:21,400 --> 01:33:22,500
<font size="64">Jong Kook.</font>

3588
01:33:22,300 --> 01:33:23,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Thinking)</font>

3589
01:33:24,200 --> 01:33:25,970
<font size="64">- I think it's Jong Kook. - Seriously, it's not me.</font>

3590
01:33:24,800 --> 01:33:27,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Time to choose)</font>

3591
01:33:25,970 --> 01:33:28,640
<font size="64">- This is really hard. - One...</font>

3592
01:33:29,480 --> 01:33:30,780
<font size="64">- Who will you pick? - Ye Eun.</font>

3593
01:33:30,780 --> 01:33:31,780
<font size="64">Ye Eun?</font>

3594
01:33:31,780 --> 01:33:35,850
<font size="64">Time to pick the secretary. One, two, three.</font>

3595
01:33:32,650 --> 01:33:35,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Who will the detectives choose?)</font>

3596
01:33:37,350 --> 01:33:41,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ye Eun gets the most votes.)</font>

3597
01:33:37,380 --> 01:33:38,450
<font size="64">Seriously, it's not me.</font>

3598
01:33:39,020 --> 01:33:40,350
<font size="64">Ji Ye Eun.</font>

3599
01:33:40,990 --> 01:33:42,220
<font size="64">I chose Jong Kook.</font>

3600
01:33:42,960 --> 01:33:44,560
<font size="64">See? I said it wasn't me.</font>

3601
01:33:44,560 --> 01:33:46,590
<font size="64">- Are you sure you're choosing me? - Yes.</font>

3602
01:33:46,890 --> 01:33:47,890
<font size="64">Then, I'll pick you.</font>

3603
01:33:47,890 --> 01:33:49,230
<font size="64">I'll pick her if you don't pick me.</font>

3604
01:33:48,190 --> 01:33:49,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Threatening)</font>

3605
01:33:50,030 --> 01:33:51,830
<font size="64">What are you doing?</font>

3606
01:33:52,130 --> 01:33:53,170
<font size="64">I pick you.</font>

3607
01:33:53,170 --> 01:33:54,300
<font size="64">- Are you sure? - I choose Jong Kook.</font>

3608
01:33:54,300 --> 01:33:55,530
<font size="64">Then I pick Ye Eun.</font>

3609
01:33:55,530 --> 01:33:56,600
<font size="64">Jong Kook?</font>

3610
01:33:56,700 --> 01:33:57,940
<font size="64">- It's not me. - Is it Ye Eun?</font>

3611
01:33:57,270 --> 01:34:00,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The detectives choose Ye Eun as the undercover secretary.)</font>

3612
01:33:57,940 --> 01:33:59,140
<font size="64">It's not me!</font>

3613
01:33:59,140 --> 01:34:00,310
<font size="64">- Unbelievable. - Then it must be Ye Eun.</font>

3614
01:34:00,310 --> 01:34:01,970
<font size="64">- It's not me! - I was going to talk to her.</font>

3615
01:34:01,240 --> 01:34:04,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Is Ye Eun really the undercover secretary?)</font>

3616
01:34:01,970 --> 01:34:03,710
<font size="64">- Ye Eun. - You'll get the penalty too.</font>

3617
01:34:03,710 --> 01:34:05,580
<font size="64">- We all will get the penalty. - The undercover secretary...</font>

3618
01:34:05,580 --> 01:34:06,850
<font size="64">The undercover detective.</font>

3619
01:34:06,910 --> 01:34:08,480
<font size="64">is not Ye Eun.</font>

3620
01:34:08,480 --> 01:34:11,050
<font size="64">- See? - See? I told you!</font>

3621
01:34:08,550 --> 01:34:11,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team Detective failed to catch the undercover secretary.)</font>

3622
01:34:11,050 --> 01:34:12,820
<font size="64">- It's Jong Kook! It's not me. - All right.</font>

3623
01:34:11,720 --> 01:34:15,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Then who among them is the undercover secretary?)</font>

3624
01:34:12,820 --> 01:34:14,320
<font size="64">The undercover secretary should reveal their identity now.</font>

3625
01:34:14,320 --> 01:34:15,320
<font size="64">It's Jong Kook.</font>

3626
01:34:15,390 --> 01:34:17,560
<font size="64">- One, two, three. - Is it Eun Chae?</font>

3627
01:34:18,220 --> 01:34:19,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jung Eun Chae)</font>

3628
01:34:21,460 --> 01:34:23,200
<font size="64">Darn it!</font>

3629
01:34:23,030 --> 01:34:24,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chairman!)</font>

3630
01:34:23,500 --> 01:34:24,530
<font size="64">See?</font>

3631
01:34:24,160 --> 01:34:26,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A heartwarming high five with the chairman!)</font>

3632
01:34:24,530 --> 01:34:25,660
<font size="64">- I told you! - Is it Eun Chae?</font>

3633
01:34:25,730 --> 01:34:26,730
<font size="64">It's unbelievable.</font>

3634
01:34:26,730 --> 01:34:28,670
<font size="64">- Isn't it Se Chan? - How could we have found it out?</font>

3635
01:34:28,000 --> 01:34:29,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The undercover secretary hidden among Team Detective...)</font>

3636
01:34:28,670 --> 01:34:29,970
<font size="64">- Isn't it Se Chan? - It's not me.</font>

3637
01:34:29,600 --> 01:34:31,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(was Eun Chae!)</font>

3638
01:34:29,970 --> 01:34:31,070
<font size="64">Isn't it you?</font>

3639
01:34:31,170 --> 01:34:33,540
<font size="64">Let me introduce the undercover secretary...</font>

3640
01:34:31,240 --> 01:34:34,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(During Chairman Ha's opening and rule briefing)</font>

3641
01:34:33,540 --> 01:34:35,070
<font size="64">to plant in Team Detective.</font>

3642
01:34:35,510 --> 01:34:38,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Secretary Jung greeted Chairman Ha during the opening.)</font>

3643
01:34:35,610 --> 01:34:38,240
<font size="64">- Hello. - Hello. I'm the Chairman.</font>

3644
01:34:38,340 --> 01:34:40,580
<font size="64">- Okay. That's right. - Mine.</font>

3645
01:34:38,980 --> 01:34:40,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Secretary Jung's contribution)</font>

3646
01:34:40,710 --> 01:34:42,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Intentionally giving away points in the foot volleyball match...)</font>

3647
01:34:40,780 --> 01:34:42,750
<font size="64">- Jung Eun Chae! - Header, Eun Chae!</font>

3648
01:34:42,280 --> 01:34:43,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(while pretending to do slapstick comedy)</font>

3649
01:34:44,050 --> 01:34:46,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Se Chan lost his hints to Bo Hyun.)</font>

3650
01:34:44,180 --> 01:34:46,350
<font size="64">I lost all six hints.</font>

3651
01:34:46,920 --> 01:34:48,490
<font size="64">Isn't it that you let him steal them?</font>

3652
01:34:48,490 --> 01:34:50,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Framing Se Chan as the spy...)</font>

3653
01:34:48,590 --> 01:34:51,260
<font size="64">- Who? I didn't. - Bo Hyun is probably the chairman.</font>

3654
01:34:50,920 --> 01:34:54,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(to dodge suspicion herself)</font>

3655
01:34:51,260 --> 01:34:54,330
<font size="64">- And he's the secretary. So... - Right.</font>

3656
01:34:54,160 --> 01:34:55,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Laughing)</font>

3657
01:34:56,230 --> 01:34:57,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(And throughout the race...)</font>

3658
01:34:56,330 --> 01:34:57,960
<font size="64">I got a text message.</font>

3659
01:34:57,960 --> 01:34:59,670
<font size="64">I got a message from her.</font>

3660
01:34:58,300 --> 01:34:59,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If you see me, please rip off my name tag.)</font>

3661
01:34:59,370 --> 01:35:00,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(You're being suspected for laughing when Jong Kook gave away a point.)</font>

3662
01:34:59,670 --> 01:35:00,930
<font size="64">"You're under suspicion."</font>

3663
01:35:00,430 --> 01:35:04,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Reporting things to the chairman and asking him to be careful)</font>

3664
01:35:00,930 --> 01:35:02,300
<font size="64">"Please be careful."</font>

3665
01:35:02,300 --> 01:35:04,200
<font size="64">See? She is truly loyal.</font>

3666
01:35:04,200 --> 01:35:05,400
<font size="64">- Who will you pick? - Ye Eun.</font>

3667
01:35:05,400 --> 01:35:06,410
<font size="64">- Ye Eun? - Yes.</font>

3668
01:35:06,140 --> 01:35:08,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Even subtly leading the majority vote...)</font>

3669
01:35:06,410 --> 01:35:08,640
<font size="64">Time to pick the secretary. One, two, three.</font>

3670
01:35:08,240 --> 01:35:10,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(toward Ye Eun in the final vote)</font>

3671
01:35:08,840 --> 01:35:10,340
<font size="64">It's not Ji Ye Eun.</font>

3672
01:35:10,340 --> 01:35:11,410
<font size="64">- See? - I told you.</font>

3673
01:35:10,940 --> 01:35:12,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(I survived.)</font>

3674
01:35:11,410 --> 01:35:12,810
<font size="64">- I said it wasn't me! - She said it wasn't her.</font>

3675
01:35:12,850 --> 01:35:15,820
<font size="64">She really masterminded so many things.</font>

3676
01:35:13,480 --> 01:35:15,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The novice undercover secretary did an impressive job.)</font>

3677
01:35:15,820 --> 01:35:17,680
<font size="64">How are we supposed to know when she barely talks?</font>

3678
01:35:17,980 --> 01:35:19,120
<font size="64">- She's so quiet. - Why are you yelling?</font>

3679
01:35:18,980 --> 01:35:21,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Upset)</font>

3680
01:35:19,120 --> 01:35:21,990
<font size="64">- She talks only when she buys gold! - She only speaks when buying gold!</font>

3681
01:35:22,320 --> 01:35:23,660
<font size="64">How would we know?</font>

3682
01:35:23,660 --> 01:35:25,490
<font size="64">I said it wasn't me!</font>

3683
01:35:23,690 --> 01:35:25,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ddochi feels very wronged.)</font>

3684
01:35:25,490 --> 01:35:26,790
<font size="64">- But... - About Eun Chae,</font>

3685
01:35:26,790 --> 01:35:28,030
<font size="64">Jong Kook and I said this.</font>

3686
01:35:27,090 --> 01:35:30,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Eun Chae made a fool out of the veteran detectives.)</font>

3687
01:35:28,030 --> 01:35:30,760
<font size="64">If it's Eun Chae, there's no way we can guess it.</font>

3688
01:35:30,660 --> 01:35:32,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Good job!)</font>

3689
01:35:30,830 --> 01:35:32,800
<font size="64">Except for the undercover detective,</font>

3690
01:35:32,800 --> 01:35:35,170
<font size="64">the five members of Team Detective and the undercover secretary...</font>

3691
01:35:32,800 --> 01:35:34,970
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(To Team Flex and Eun Chae who've won...)</font>

3692
01:35:35,170 --> 01:35:37,400
<font size="64">will be given seasonal fruit sets and the items...</font>

3693
01:35:35,900 --> 01:35:37,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The gift of seasonal fruit...)</font>

3694
01:35:37,400 --> 01:35:39,240
<font size="64">purchased during the mission.</font>

3695
01:35:37,670 --> 01:35:40,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(and the items from the mission!)</font>

3696
01:35:40,810 --> 01:35:41,810
<font size="64">That's a lot.</font>

3697
01:35:41,810 --> 01:35:43,880
<font size="64">- I want Eun Chae to have the gold. - Okay.</font>

3698
01:35:43,980 --> 01:35:45,080
<font size="64">The gold should go to Eun Chae.</font>

3699
01:35:45,980 --> 01:35:47,380
<font size="64">- Congratulations. - No.</font>

3700
01:35:47,380 --> 01:35:48,580
<font size="64">But I want this.</font>

3701
01:35:49,450 --> 01:35:51,350
<font size="64">- This is more expensive. - Isn't this gold?</font>

3702
01:35:51,350 --> 01:35:52,450
<font size="64">- Is this gold? - This is also gold.</font>

3703
01:35:52,450 --> 01:35:53,550
<font size="64">She's impressive.</font>

3704
01:35:53,550 --> 01:35:55,050
<font size="64">I didn't know Eun Chae could speak so quickly.</font>

3705
01:35:53,750 --> 01:35:55,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Amazed)</font>

3706
01:35:55,050 --> 01:35:56,790
<font size="64">- She's blinded by gold. - Her nickname is Gold Chae.</font>

3707
01:35:56,790 --> 01:35:58,520
<font size="64">- This is for Sang Jun. - Okay. Sang Jun.</font>

3708
01:35:58,520 --> 01:35:59,560
<font size="64">- Good. - Thank you.</font>

